  "3057": {
    "solution": [
      {
        "msg": "Nech:\n$$\n(x_1, x_2)^T = a_1 \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) + a_2\\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right) \\\\\n(y_1, y_2)^T = b_1 \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) + b_2\\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right)\n$$\nPotom:\n$$\n\\begin{align*}\n\\langle (x_1, x_2)^T, (y_1, y_2)^T \\rangle &= \\left\\langle a_1 \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) + a_2\\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right), b_1 \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) + b_2\\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right) \\right\\rangle \\\\\n&=\\overline{a_1}b_1\\left\\langle \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right), \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) \\right\\rangle + \\overline{a_1}b_2 \\left\\langle\\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right), \\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right) \\right\\rangle + \\overline{a_2}b_1\\left\\langle \\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right), \\left(\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\2 \\end{array}\\right) \\right\\rangle + \\overline{a_2}b_2 \\left\\langle \\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right),\\left(\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\7 \\end{array}\\right) \\right\\rangle \\\\\n&= \\overline{a_1}b_1 + \\overline{a_2}b_2\n\\end{align*}\n$$\nKde poslendá rovnosť plynia z ortonormality bázy $B$. Teda skalárny súčin vektorov vieme získať ako štandardný skalárny súčin súradníc vektorov vzhľadom na bázu $B$. Matica prechodu z kanonickej bázy do bázy $B$ je:\n$$\n[id]_B^K = \\left(\\left[\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\ 0\\end{array}\\right]_B \\Big| \\left[\\begin{array}{c}0 \\\\ 1\\end{array}\\right]_B\\right) = \\left(\\begin{array}{cc} 7 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\end{array}\\right)\n$$\nTo znamená, že:\n$$\n\\begin{align*}\n\\langle (x_1, x_2)^T, (y_1, y_2)^T \\rangle &= \\left(\\begin{array}{cc} 7 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\end{array}\\right)\\left(\\begin{array}{c}x_1 \\\\x_2 \\end{array}\\right) \\cdot \\left(\\begin{array}{cc} 7 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\end{array}\\right)\\left(\\begin{array}{c}y_1 \\\\y_2 \\end{array}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\overline{(7x_1 - 3x_2)}(7y_1 - 3y_2) + \\overline{(-2x_1 + x_2)}(-2y_1 - y_2)\n\\end{align*}\n$$\nkde $\\cdot$ bol štandardný skalárny súčin."
      }
    ]
  },
